    "detailed_description": "<br>\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<br>\u203bIf you are unable to launch the game, please download the missing system components.<br>Extract the downloaded folder and copy the three DLL files to C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64.<br>\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244080/extras/0642fc7fce18223a0dac0ad776503159.webp?t=1752717843\" /></span><br>Mio is an adventurer who dived into a dungeon, dreaming of getting rich.<br>She falls into a pit and, battered and bruised, obtains a holy sword called Aphrodite.<br><br>However, the holy sword is a magical sword with special powers.<br><br>Mio is bewildered, but still wants a weapon.<br>So she decides to proceed to explore the dungeon with Aphrodite in hand...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244080/extras/10a4458b75462c71f635abca9873f614.webp?t=1752717843\" /></span><br>This is a Dungeon Crawler ARPG.<br>You fight monsters while solving puzzles to open the next room in each dungeon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244080/extras/988a4aff11e4d06fc8091ce64493e363.webp?t=1752717843\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dot pictures<br></li><li>Puzzle-solving<br></li><li>Multiple difficulty levels</li></ul>",
